  "style": "Ten nights at a lighthouse across one year, each in its own idiom (chamber folk, storm prog, fog ambient, 6/8 jig, mallet minimalism, 5/4 noir, night-sky electronica, orchestral scherzo, 12/8 slow blues, cathedral finale), bound by a five-note BEAM cell stated on every track and a 16-bar keeper's hymn that opens and crowns the year \u2014 every recurrence machine-verified.",
